ative Club\", where she's distressed over the lack of increasing numbers."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She collects mascots from gachapons."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89817"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2f/2f6d9f2a36eafcc6ffacd5397ebeff58ce33b9c0122359156e91f683592e7abc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/dbcea215dab7d0152a9214a5188ddea389e487eb6da8c58b56eb8f281f6270dc.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"澤田 なつ","creatorId":"vndb:s362","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s362","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s362","name":"福圓 美里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:84459","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c89818","characterName":"柊 栞里","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c89818"},"originalCharacterName":"柊 栞里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1203"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"72"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"146"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"75"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"51"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Watching YuoTube."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite foods: Candies and marshmallows."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I didn't mean it like that. But every time I noticed, I ended up being alone.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a 1st year at Kazami Academy and a part of the Active Club."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She essentially expressionless and doesn't have much of a reaction."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She absentmindedly looks at the sky, plants, and animals all by herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It's not like she has a cold personality. She has a frivolous existence because her class has a tough time approaching her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As she was dozing around the place where Hibiki was dancing, she joined the Active Club based on the flow that was going on."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She seems to have a favorite YuoTube channel to watch and often checks those videos during break time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89818"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0d986e2cd46d86cc827ee10b7bf56daff1319883f38e459f3bb94b6c8011d3e0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/742ea7f22a92d7e17b4b7af890389e996befd0c38b81e929bde6584faddc3b69.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"丸葉 沙綾","creatorId":"vndb:s469","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s469","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s469","name":"後藤 麻衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:84463","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c89819","characterName":"海堂 凪子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c89819"},"originalCharacterName":"海堂 凪子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"527"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Marine sports and Aikidos."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite foods: Yakisoba Bread and stew."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"What? You sure have quite a rude attitude towards the very kind upperclassman who caught you.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a 3rd year at Kazami Academy and a part of the Active Club."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With an easy-going personality, she has an older sister disposition who cares for others. There are tons of people in her surroundings that rely on her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's shy and has a low tolerance when it comes to guys, which ends up having her take a cold attitude towards them by mistake, and got disheartened with self-hatred as she tells herself that she is inexperienced."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is Hibiki's cousin. She wanted to be around Hibiki who like her cute little sister, so she decided to join the Active Club."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She seems capable in every sport and has been doing marine sports and aikido since she was a child."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89819"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/794afc9cc3337c35ece63339b2f1e5b6df7b0d92f3c93fb3fe8c725437a613e4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/527aabf7c516fdf0c351852c1cb348e1ad89fb419ae2e4a1f5017b4b992ff9a5.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"明羽 杏子","creatorId":"vndb:s14378","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14378","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14378","name":"長谷川 育美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:84461","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c89820","characterName":"聖 橘花","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c89820"},"originalCharacterName":"聖 橘花","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"108"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"153"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Teasing Senpai (Yuu)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite foods: Ramen and Potato Chips."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"It's been a while! What's up, Toono-senpai! It's your lovely, lovely underclassman, Hijiri Kikka!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a 1st year at Kazami Academy and has no club affiliation. She is Yuu's underclassman, being a year below him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She won't tell him which class or club she's in for some reason."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She always confuses him by saying \"It doesn't matter, does it? Senpai, you totally like me, right?\". She easily gets carried away, regardless of the person's age or gender, and gets overly familiar with everyone with absolutely zero distance."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her hobby is teasing Yuu. It seems she finds his reactions amusing compared to the other guys."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Website"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is the person who saved the protagonist from drowning when he was 8 years old, and she has been in a coma ever since. By the time of the epilogue, she has been in a coma for 10 years."}],"source":"vndb","sourc