":false,"text":"With an extremely cute personality, she is a mature honor student who is liked by everyone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She makes sure to be responsible for all the housework in the Toono Household."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"There are times when she acts cheeky towards Yuu, but she has a severe brother complex. She'll indiscriminately love any appeal he has."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With her older brother desperately working hard for his own sake, she wants him to live a better school life---an enjoyable youth."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89821"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/357d2e431b0678be0fb5027c3d353823b445a349ec2b16111e3f1cb5e0ace761.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e105b7bab6f7a8ab815cd46629570509dc4c59969bbb5d364aa884059faaf2ee.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"上原 あおい","creatorId":"vndb:s607","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s607","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s607","name":"深田 愛衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:84460","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c91884","characterName":"岬 和水","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c91884"},"originalCharacterName":"岬 和水","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/87/872b439bf97e55ec1d46b24b06713837b952620bbcccbc4e2c566130cfbed91b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/75f0597d31e3a81cf369af385d20e0